      "status": "Example loaded. Compute to inspect it.",
      "body": "Skip to the experiment\nRECALLWEAVE · AN OFFLINE ALGORITHM LAB\nEdit distance\n\nChange a string. Inspect every prefix decision. Replay one cheapest transformation.\n\nExact insertion, deletion and substitution costs. No transposition, text normalization or meaning comparison.\n\nTake the reasoning into a lesson\n\nTwelve original questions connect operations, prefix states, ties and representation. Download the course and open it through RecallWeave's existing local lesson preview.\n\nDownload lessonDownload worked guide\nChoose a transformation\nWorked example\nA leading insertion\nTwo best alignments\nCheaper to delete and insert\nEmpty is a real prefix\nA swap is not one edit\nScalars are not graphemes\nLoad example\nSource string\nTarget string\n\n0–16 Unicode scalar values per string. Empty strings, spaces and letter case are retained. Scalars are not necessarily displayed characters: é and e + combining acute differ here. C0/DEL controls and unpaired surrogates are refused.\n\nInsertion cost\nDeletion cost\nSubstitution cost\n\nEach cost is a whole number from 1 to 9. Identical-symbol matches cost 0. Unequal costs minimize total cost, which can differ from the fewest edits.\n\nCompute minimum cost\nDownload experiment\n\nExample loaded. Compute to inspect it.\n\nOriginal RecallWeave lesson and explorer, with AI assistance. Runs locally without network requests or automatic storage. Experiment files are records, not learner archives. No learning-efficacy or semantic-similarity claim is made."
